<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The proof is identical to the proof of Lemma <a href="/tag/072D" data-tag="072D">96.19.11</a> except that it uses an injective resolution in $\textit{Mod}(\mathcal{X}_\tau , \mathcal{O}_\mathcal {X})$ and it uses Lemma <a href="/tag/06X2" data-tag="06X2">96.17.6</a> instead of Lemma <a href="/tag/06X1" data-tag="06X1">96.17.5</a>. 
